The Game Content Usage Rules also require that anything built under them stays
free. Age of RMS is free, carries no advertising and has no paid tier, and
that applies to any future tool registry as well.

Contributors should keep the line where it currently sits. Facts about the
game and the names of things are in scope. Art, audio, binary game files and
Microsoft's own written documentation are not, so do not copy prose out of the
scripting guide DE ships in its `Docs` directory into this project's help
text. Educational content is written by hand.

